# A sequence (LLP 1125): the count-in, polymeter, an edit, a tempo change,
# stopSounds, a key restart, the gate's stop, and a finite take's ended=.
tap start
clock +700
clock +1600
tap edit
clock +900
tap faster
clock +1300
tap quiet
clock +400
tap restart
clock +2600
tap stop
clock +500
tap finite
clock +4000
clock +4000
